<title>AUSTRIA: Iran says OPEC output rollover best if quotas held.</title>
<headline>Iran says OPEC output rollover best if quotas held.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iranian oil minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh said on Wednesday that he favoured an OPEC output rollover if quotas were adhered to.</p>
<p>Asked if a rollover would be the best solution for OPEC he said &quot;it is the best if everyone sticks to their quota. If not I don't know.&quot;</p>
</text>
